## All Commands
| Command | What it does |
|---------|-------------|
| `pnpm run bootstrap` | pnpm install |
| `pnpm run build` | cross-env NODE_OPTIONS=--max-old-space-size=8192 turbo build |
| `pnpm run build:analyze` | turbo build:analyze |
| `pnpm run build:antd` | pnpm run build --filter=@vben/web-antd |
| `pnpm run build:antdv-next` | pnpm run build --filter=@vben/web-antdv-next |
| `pnpm run build:docker` | ./scripts/deploy/build-local-docker-image.sh |
| `pnpm run build:docs` | pnpm run build --filter=@vben/docs |
| `pnpm run build:ele` | pnpm run build --filter=@vben/web-ele |
| `pnpm run build:naive` | pnpm run build --filter=@vben/web-naive |
| `pnpm run build:tdesign` | pnpm run build --filter=@vben/web-tdesign |
| `pnpm run changeset` | pnpm exec changeset |
| `pnpm run check` | pnpm run check:circular && pnpm run check:dep && pnpm run check:type && pnpm check:cspell |
| `pnpm run check:circular` | vsh check-circular |
| `pnpm run check:cspell` | cspell lint "**/*.ts" "**/README.md" ".changeset/*.md" --no-progress |
| `pnpm run check:dep` | vsh check-dep |
| `pnpm run check:type` | turbo run typecheck |
| `pnpm run clean` | node ./scripts/clean.mjs |
| `pnpm run commit` | czg |
| `pnpm run dev` | turbo-run dev |
| `pnpm run dev:antd` | pnpm -F @vben/web-antd run dev |
| `pnpm run dev:antdv-next` | pnpm -F @vben/web-antdv-next run dev |
| `pnpm run dev:docs` | pnpm -F @vben/docs run dev |
| `pnpm run dev:ele` | pnpm -F @vben/web-ele run dev |
| `pnpm run dev:naive` | pnpm -F @vben/web-naive run dev |
| `pnpm run dev:tdesign` | pnpm -F @vben/web-tdesign run dev |
| `pnpm run format` | vsh lint --format |
| `pnpm run lint` | vsh lint |
| `pnpm run postinstall` | pnpm -r run --if-present stub |
| `pnpm run preinstall` | npx only-allow pnpm |
| `pnpm run prepare` | is-ci || pnpm exec lefthook install |
| `pnpm run preview` | turbo-run preview |
| `pnpm run publint` | vsh publint |
| `pnpm run reinstall` | pnpm run clean -- --del-lock && pnpm install |
| `pnpm run test:unit` | vitest run --dom |
| `pnpm run test:e2e` | turbo run test:e2e |
| `pnpm run update:deps` | npx taze -r -w |
| `pnpm run version` | pnpm exec changeset version && pnpm install --no-frozen-lockfile |
| `pnpm run catalog` | pnpm dlx codemod pnpm/catalog |

